  "The Copper Pot: Modern British small plates and Sunday roasts, at 14 Call Lane, Leeds LS1 6DT.",
  "Sunday: 12 noon till 5pm. Tuesday to Thursday: lunch 12 noon till 3pm, dinner 6pm till 10:30pm. Friday and Saturday: brunch 9:30am till 11:30am, lunch 12 noon till 3pm, dinner 5pm till 11pm. Closed Mondays.",
  "Seating: main room (7 tables), courtyard (4 tables), bar (2 tables, walk-in only), the snug (1 table, private hire by enquiry) and mezzanine (3 tables). The courtyard is bookable, but in bad weather we cannot promise a table inside. We keep some tables back for walk-ins.",
